14
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,510
a reserve you fund from any

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,010
chain through NEAR Intents.

16
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,190
And it's proven on NEAR mainnet:

17
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,830
real money moved from NEAR into

18
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,070
a Hyperliquid perps balance in under

19
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:37,550
