20
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,490
NEAR Intents swaps your funds from

21
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,890
any chain into USDC on NEAR,

22
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,690
and you deposit it into the

23
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:46,390
Lifeline vault.

24
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,130
Then set your rules:

25
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,570
