41
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,850
So we assume it gets hacked.

42
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,450
On the attack page,

43
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,510
anyone can play a hacked keeper

44
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,570
