45
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,370
It tries to pay itself.

46
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,810
The vault refuses,

47
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:29,770
on chain.

48
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,190
The key can only call rescue,

49
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:34,490
and the vault checks every quote itself.

50
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,310
Edit a signed quote.

51
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,110
Take more than the cap.

52
00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:40,790
Replay an old one.

53
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,030
Seven tricks,

54
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,530
seven refusals.

55
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:45,910
Don't trust us:

56
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:48,310
